+// CoMaps app does: camera (centre, fractional scale, azimuth), my-position follow modes,
+// navigation camera, route lines and user marks/tracks used as overlays.
+//
+// Java side: app.organicmaps.sdk.NaviDrape (compiled into the Navi app, not the CoMaps SDK).
